<mxfile host="drawio" version="24.7.17">
  <diagram id="core-tuning-flow" name="Tuning flow">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="1060" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="0" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1000" pageHeight="1060" background="#FFFFFF" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="title" value="Hyperparameter tuning inside SkyulfPipeline.fit()" style="text;html=0;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A19;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="0" width="900" height="34" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b_cfg" value="modeling config&#xa;type: hyperparameter_tuner&#xa;base_model, strategy,&#xa;search_space, metric, cv_*" style="rounded=1;html=0;arcSize=10;fillColor=#EAF2FF;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#1A1A19;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="50" width="220" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a_prefix" value="1. Steps up to the split run once&#xa;raw train / test / optional validation rows;&#xa;later steps become a recipe refit per fold" style="rounded=1;html=0;arcSize=10;fillColor=#FFF4E5;strokeColor=#D79B00;fontColor=#1A1A19;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="290" y="55" width="420" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s_test" value="Test rows&#xa;kept aside; never used&#xa;to pick parameters" style="rounded=1;html=0;arcSize=10;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#1A1A19;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="760" y="55" width="200" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a_strategy" value="2. The search strategy proposes candidates&#xa;grid, random: Skyulf's own fold loop&#xa;halving_grid, halving_random: sklearn halving&#xa;optuna: OptunaSearchCV (tuning extra)" style="rounded=1;html=0;arcSize=10;fillColor=#FFF4E5;strokeColor=#D79B00;fontColor=#1A1A19;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="290" y="190" width="420" height="84" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d_val" value="Validation&#xa;split present?" style="rhombus;html=0;fillColor=#FFF4E5;strokeColor=#D79B00;fontColor=#1A1A19;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="400" y="330" width="200" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a_holdout" value="Holdout scoring&#xa;fit on the train rows,&#xa;score on the validation rows" style="rounded=1;html=0;arcSize=10;fillColor=#FFF4E5;strokeColor=#D79B00;fontColor=#1A1A19;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="335" width="220" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a_cv" value="CV folds by cv_type&#xa;k_fold, stratified_k_fold,&#xa;shuffle_split,&#xa;time_series_split, group folds;&#xa;cv_enabled=False: 20% holdout" style="rounded=1;html=0;arcSize=10;fillColor=#FFF4E5;strokeColor=#D79B00;fontColor=#1A1A19;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="760" y="330" width="220" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c_fold" value="3. Inside every fold&#xa;the post-split steps are refit on the fold's train rows&#xa;and applied to its held-out rows; the model with&#xa;the candidate params is fit and scored" style="rounded=1;html=0;arcSize=10;fillColor=#EAF7EE;strokeColor=#82B366;fontColor=#1A1A19;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="290" y="480" width="420" height="84" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c_best" value="4. Best params&#xa;the candidate with the best score (TuningResult)" style="rounded=1;html=0;arcSize=10;fillColor=#EAF7EE;strokeColor=#82B366;fontColor=#1A1A19;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="290" y="614" width="420" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n_nested" value="cv_type = nested_cv&#xa;outer folds only evaluate:&#xa;each runs its own inner search;&#xa;a separate search over all&#xa;training rows picks the model" style="rounded=1;html=0;arcSize=10;fillColor=#FFF4E5;strokeColor=#D79B00;fontColor=#1A1A19;fontSize=12;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="600" width="220" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c_refit" value="5. Final refit on the full training split&#xa;preprocessing fit once on all training rows,&#xa;then the model with the best params;&#xa;this chain is what predict() uses" style="rounded=1;html=0;arcSize=10;fillColor=#EAF7EE;strokeColor=#82B366;fontColor=#1A1A19;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="290" y="724" width="420" height="84" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a_eval" value="6. Evaluation&#xa;test rows (and validation rows) are transformed&#xa;by the final chain and scored once" style="rounded=1;html=0;arcSize=10;fillColor=#FFF4E5;strokeColor=#D79B00;fontColor=#1A1A19;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="290" y="858" width="420" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_metrics" value="Metrics per split + tuning result&#xa;(best params, best score, every trial)" style="rounded=1;html=0;arcSize=10;fillColor=#F3E8FF;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontColor=#1A1A19;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="290" y="978" width="420" height="56" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="k_title" value="Colour key" style="text;html=0;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A19;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="760" width="220" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="k0" value="Input" style="rounded=1;html=0;arcSize=10;fillColor=#EAF2FF;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#1A1A19;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
